HDDS-7489.description:
We need a Freon tool to simulate a number of datanodes and coordinate with SCM to create a number of containers on the simulated datanodes. This will help to verify the capability of SCM to handle thousand of nodes and exabytes of data.

Example usage: a simulation of 5K datanodes with 40K containers per datanode, i.e. simulating 1 exabyte of raw data. 

 
{code:java}
ozone freon simulate-datanode -t 20 -n 5000 -c 40000 {code}

